  evidencePrefab: {fileID: 6586202626002414144, guid: b02f6cf486235c440987b4f4073b828e, type: 3}
  storyName: N/A
  storyDate: N/A
  storyDescription: "Have you heard the stories of the beast around these parts?
    We call it The Helpme because that's all you\u2019ll be yelling when it gets
    ya. HAHAHAHA. Nothing more than a legend that we tell the kids around these parts
    though. But now people are really starting to believe it. Apparently the Madison\u2019s
    boy had an encounter with some animal a little ways down the river that leads
    into the woods. Something furry but scaly he said and that when he came across
    it, it seemed to be eating a cat or something. The poor kid said he was chased
    down to the main road and almost got run over by neighbor George who lives a
    few streets down. I would say it was just the imagination of some kid thinkin
    he saw the Helpme, but George says as the kid was jumping into the car something
    thumped into the side and scratched furiously at the side of the car until he
    got far enough away. You should go talk to him, haven\u2019t seen him leave his
    house yet so he should still be there."
  storyComments: "I visited George\u2019s house to have a conversation. The house
    was a mess. He was not breathing when I found him. I would check on the Madisons\u2019
    kid but I can\u2019t risk it with one person already dead. They may have been
    marked. "
